<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>About - Followers Master</title>

<style>
*{
  box-sizing:border-box;
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
  font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
  background:#f4f6fb;
  color:#172033;
}

.sidebar{
  position:fixed;
  left:0;
  top:0;
  width:240px;
  height:100vh;
  background:#0b1424;
  color:white;
  padding:22px 14px;
}

.logo{
  font-size:23px;
  font-weight:bold;
  padding:8px 14px 28px;
}

.logo span{
  color:#7657ff;
}

.menu a{
  display:block;
  color:#d9deeb;
  text-decoration:none;
  padding:14px;
  margin:5px 0;
  border-radius:9px;
}

.menu a:hover,
.menu a.active{
  background:#6948ef;
  color:white;
}

.main{
  margin-left:240px;
  min-height:100vh;
}

.top{
  height:72px;
  background:white;
  border-bottom:1px solid #e7e9ef;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  padding:0 28px;
}

.balance{
  font-weight:bold;
  color:#5c43df;
}

.content{
  max-width:900px;
  margin:24px auto;
  padding:0 16px;
}

.card{
  background:white;
  border:1px solid #e0e3ea;
  border-radius:14px;
  padding:30px;
  box-shadow:0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.04);
  margin-bottom:18px;
}

.hero{
  background:#f3efff;
  border:1px solid #ded6ff;
  text-align:center;
}

.hero h1{
  color:#6045e7;
  font-size:32px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}

.hero p{
  color:#5d6678;
  line-height:1.7;
}

h2{
  color:#6045e7;
  margin-bottom:12px;
}

p{
  color:#5d6678;
  line-height:1.8;
}

.features{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  gap:15px;
  margin-top:20px;
}

.feature{
  border:1px solid #e2e4ea;
  border-radius:10px;
  padding:20px;
  background:#fcfcff;
}

.feature h3{
  margin-bottom:8px;
}

.feature p{
  font-size:14px;
  line-height:1.6;
}

.contact{
  background:#eefaf2;
  border:1px solid #bfe2ca;
}

.mobile{
  display:none;
}

@media(max-width:800px){

  .sidebar{
    left:-250px;
    transition:.25s;
  }

  .sidebar.show{
    left:0;
  }

  .main{
    margin-left:0;
  }

  .mobile{
    display:block;
    background:#6948ef;
    color:white;
    border:0;
    border-radius:7px;
    padding:8px 11px;
    margin-right:10px;
  }

  .top-left{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
  }

  .content{
    margin:15px auto;
    padding:0 12px;
  }

  .features{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }

  .card{
    padding:22px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">

  <div class="logo">
    ♛ Followers <span>Master</span>
  </div>

  <nav class="menu">

    <a href="index.html">⌂ Dashboard</a>

    <a href="index.html">☷ New Order</a>

    <a href="#">▣ My Orders</a>

    <a href="#">⚙ Services</a>

    <a href="index.html">▣ Add Funds</a>

    <a href="#">↻ Transactions</a>

    <a href="about.html" class="active">
      ⓘ About
    </a>

    <a href="#">? Support</a>

  </nav>

</aside>


<main class="main">

<header class="top">

  <div class="top-left">

    <button
      class="mobile"
      onclick="toggleMenu()">
      ☰
    </button>

    <h2>About Us</h2>

  </div>

  <div class="balance">
    Balance: ₹0.00
  </div>

</header>


<section class="content">

  <div class="card hero">

    <h1>
      About Followers Master
    </h1>

    <p>
      Welcome to Followers Master — a simple and
      user-friendly social media service panel
      designed to make managing your orders easy
      and convenient.
    </p>

  </div>


  <div class="card">

    <h2>
      Who We Are
    </h2>

    <p>
      Followers Master is a modern web-based panel
      concept where users can browse available social
      media services, place orders and manage their
      account from one convenient dashboard.
    </p>


    <div class="features">

      <div class="feature">

        <h3>
          ⚡ Easy to Use
        </h3>

        <p>
          Simple navigation and a clean interface make
          the panel easy to use on both mobile and
          desktop devices.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="feature">

        <h3>
          📱 Mobile Friendly
        </h3>

        <p>
          The website is responsive and designed to
          work smoothly on smartphones, tablets and
          computers.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="feature">

        <h3>
          🔒 Account Safety
        </h3>

        <p>
          Keep your account credentials and payment
          PINs private. Never share OTPs or UPI PINs.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>


  <div class="card">

    <h2>
      Our Goal
    </h2>

    <p>
      Our goal is to provide a straightforward
      dashboard experience with clear service
      information, easy order management and a
      convenient payment interface.
    </p>

  </div>


  <div class="card contact">

    <h2>
      Need Help?
    </h2>

    <p>
      If you need assistance with your account or
      an order, please use the Support section of
      the website.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>

</main>


<script>

function toggleMenu(){

  document
    .getElementById("sidebar")
    .classList.toggle("show");

}

</script>

</body>
</html>